      "content": "what path forward though? even if i try to start over, the same people are still in power and the same patterns just repeat. it's like trying to swim upstream in a hurricane. every move just makes me more tired. it's not even about being angry anymore, i'm just... done. i'm exhausted by the whole idea of existing in a world that works like this. it's just fundamentally broken, isn't it?",
